<title>USA: Port of Oakland $262 mln repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Port of Oakland $262 mln repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it repriced Port of Oakland, Calif.'s $262.1 million bond deal, lowering yields in some maturities and cutting the top yield in 2025 to 5.89 percent from 5.91 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
